sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Nhân viên / quản trị viên
    participant C as ShipmentController và OrderController
    participant SH as ShipmentServiceImpl
    participant F as OrderFulfillmentServiceImpl
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant N as NotificationEventListener
    participant SMTP as SMTP
    S->>C: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/shipments (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>SH: create(changedBy, orderId, request)
    SH->>DB: Khóa Order, kiểm COD PENDING, ghi Shipment READY
    S->>C: PUT /api/v1/shipments/{id}/status = IN_TRANSIT (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>SH: updateStatus(changedBy, shipmentId, request)
    SH->>DB: Đổi Shipment IN_TRANSIT, Order SHIPPING
    Note over SH,N: Sau transaction commit
    SH->>N: OrderShippedEvent (Spring event)
    N->>SMTP: Gửi email giao hàng (SMTP, @Async)
    S->>C: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/fulfillment/complete (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>F: completeDelivery(changedBy, orderId, request)
    F->>DB: Khóa các bản ghi và kiểm trạng thái COD trước khi hoàn tất
    F->>DB: Shipment DELIVERED, Payment SUCCESS, Order DELIVERED và history
    C-->>S: 200 OrderResponse
